
Commands:
  :help, :h, ?       Show help
  :quit, :q, :exit   Exit the REPL
  :type, :t <expr>   Show an expression's type
  :load, :l <file>   Load declarations from a file
  :reset, :r         Clear session definitions
  :defs, :d          List session definitions
  :llvm <expr>       Show generated LLVM IR
  :time <expr>       Time expression evaluation
  :explain <topic>   Explain a diagnostic, keyword or @tag

Tips:
  • Define functions: (fn (add x y) (+ x y))
  • Type signatures: (:: add (-> Int Int Int))
  • Data types: (data Maybe (a) (Nothing) (Just a))
  • Expressions are evaluated and results shown
  • Use ; for line comments
  • Unbalanced input continues on the next line; two blank lines abort the entry
  • No history or line editing; Ctrl+D ends the session, Ctrl+C kills it


